{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "the-naked-director-s02e01-scene-09",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "衛星放送についてご存じですか？  (Have You Heard of Satellite Broadcasting?)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kacho": "課長",
    "muranishi": "村西"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Right in the middle of Takei's lecture, Muranishi's cell phone rings: a smooth-talking bank Section Chief pitches a brand-new venture in space satellite broadcasting while secretly eyeing a huge loan fee.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "この間お勧めした土地ご購入の件、そろそろいかがです？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "まだちょっと検討してまして。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "近い将来爆発的に普及する衛星放送についてご存じですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いえ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "今週か来週辺りでご都合のいい時間があれば…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "これから行きましょう。とにかくそれを見に行きましょう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "はい、分かりました。それではお迎えに上がります。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "衛星放送っていうのはどういうもんなんですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "簡単に言うと、宇宙衛星を経由して放送するシステムです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "アンテナを使って電波を宇宙に飛ばすんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "宇宙？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "そう、宇宙です。私は夢のあるビジネスには融資を惜しみません。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "この間お勧めした土地ご購入の件、そろそろいかがです？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How are you feeling about buying that parcel of land I recommended recently?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "まだちょっと検討してまして。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am still thinking that one over.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "近い将来爆発的に普及する衛星放送についてご存じですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Have you heard of satellite broadcasting, which will soon spread explosively?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いえ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, I haven't.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "今週か来週辺りでご都合のいい時間があれば…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you have a convenient time sometime this week or next week...'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "これから行きましょう。とにかくそれを見に行きましょう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let's go right now. Whatever it is, let's go see it in person.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "はい、分かりました。それではお迎えに上がります。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Certainly, understood. I will come pick you up right away.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "衛星放送っていうのはどういうもんなんですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just what kind of thing is satellite broadcasting?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "簡単に言うと、宇宙衛星を経由して放送するシステムです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Simply put, it is a system that broadcasts by relaying signals through space satellites.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "アンテナを使って電波を宇宙に飛ばすんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You use giant antennas to beam radio waves straight up into space.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "宇宙？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Outer space?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "そう、宇宙です。私は夢のあるビジネスには融資を惜しみません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, outer space. I never hold back financing on a business with a big dream.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
